(6965112, 1050375, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this!   <br/> <br/>Perfect for the challenge, and soo... wonderful image!<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I love this!    Perfect for the challenge, and soo... wonderful image! (commenting only)', '2013-01-26 21:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965113, 1050734, 86447, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  I LOVE the "swirl"!!<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Whoa!  I LOVE the "swirl"!!  (commenting only)', '2013-01-26 21:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965114, 1050821, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!  I love that steam blowing... and everything else being still.<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Wonderful image!  I love that steam blowing... and everything else being still. (commenting only)', '2013-01-26 21:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965191, 1050131, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like the b&amp;w treatment. Reminds me of those historical photographs at the Made in Oregon shops.  I like the juxtaposition of the work element of the cranes beyond the Marquam Bridge and the recreational river users in the foreground.</td>', 'Like the b&w treatment. Reminds me of those historical photographs at the Made in Oregon shops.  I like the juxtaposition of the work element of the cranes beyond the Marquam Bridge and the recreational river users in the foreground.', '2013-01-27 01:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965448, 1050714, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very cool to see from the water''s edge to the distant mountains.  Unique architecture.  Foreign to me.  Excellent DOF and detail.  Some shadows are blocked up.  Overall, the light is less than enough.  7</td>', 'Very cool to see from the water''s edge to the distant mountains.  Unique architecture.  Foreign to me.  Excellent DOF and detail.  Some shadows are blocked up.  Overall, the light is less than enough.  7', '2013-01-27 14:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965449, 1050819, 54446, '<td valign="top">Looks very cold.  Maybe a bit too much saturation.  I''d like to see a smoother gradient in the sky, but there could be an inversion layer (brown cloud) hanging over the city.  7</td>', 'Looks very cold.  Maybe a bit too much saturation.  I''d like to see a smoother gradient in the sky, but there could be an inversion layer (brown cloud) hanging over the city.  7', '2013-01-27 14:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965450, 1050734, 54446, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7, in spite of all else.    I''d like it a lot more if the fisheye curves were not there, but it''s a difficult scene to photograph.  You''ve done well.  7</td>', 'I gave this a 7, in spite of all else.    I''d like it a lot more if the fisheye curves were not there, but it''s a difficult scene to photograph.  You''ve done well.  7', '2013-01-27 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965451, 1050860, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape.  7</td>', 'Nice cityscape.  7', '2013-01-27 14:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965771, 1050637, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot, I like it.  I think the actual figure could be a bit sharper, and I would have cloned out the hotspot on the figure''s head.</td>', 'This is a neat shot, I like it.  I think the actual figure could be a bit sharper, and I would have cloned out the hotspot on the figure''s head.', '2013-01-28 08:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965772, 1050753, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  I like all the shapes and angles.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great perspective.  I like all the shapes and angles.  Nice work.', '2013-01-28 08:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6965773, 1050814, 39880, '<td valign="top">Not sure why, but I get an Escher feel from this.  Nice processing.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Not sure why, but I get an Escher feel from this.  Nice processing.  One of my top picks.', '2013-01-28 08:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966092, 1050367, 10785, '<td valign="top">A wonderful scene and the people add interest. I kind of wish there were some elements closer in the foreground. The sky has an incredible amount of noise in it. High ISO during that time of day?</td>', 'A wonderful scene and the people add interest. I kind of wish there were some elements closer in the foreground. The sky has an incredible amount of noise in it. High ISO during that time of day?', '2013-01-28 23:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966093, 1050688, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the shapes of the buildings. The light is great and the centrally located cloud seems to keep the buildings grouped together well. I think it could be a bit sharper and if you didn''t do it, some lens correction could be added.</td>', 'Love the shapes of the buildings. The light is great and the centrally located cloud seems to keep the buildings grouped together well. I think it could be a bit sharper and if you didn''t do it, some lens correction could be added.', '2013-01-28 23:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966094, 1050154, 10785, '<td valign="top">Funny play on words and with the challenge title.</td>', 'Funny play on words and with the challenge title.', '2013-01-28 23:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966097, 1050092, 10785, '<td valign="top">The tilt shift effect enhances the looking from above effect nicely. The transition from the in focus area to the blurred area at the top is rather abrupt and I wonder if using a gradient on your layer mask to make the blur a bit more gradual would have helped, as well as  trying to include the man''s feet too.</td>', 'The tilt shift effect enhances the looking from above effect nicely. The transition from the in focus area to the blurred area at the top is rather abrupt and I wonder if using a gradient on your layer mask to make the blur a bit more gradual would have helped, as well as  trying to include the man''s feet too.', '2013-01-28 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966099, 1050496, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here and I just think it needs something else in the frame for balance... A truck off roading along the left path or a herd of animals on the left side... Something like that.</td>', 'I like the concept here and I just think it needs something else in the frame for balance... A truck off roading along the left path or a herd of animals on the left side... Something like that.', '2013-01-28 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966102, 1050821, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure shot. Love that you got the steeple in with such nice detail. The color of the lights is gorgeous throughout and I like the movement shown by the exhaust from the smokestack. I think I would like a wider angle to get more of the building in at the left. Here is an example of the limits of the crop sensor camera. A full frame sensor at the same zoom length would have been awesome with 40% more frame space!!</td>', 'Nice long exposure shot. Love that you got the steeple in with such nice detail. The color of the lights is gorgeous throughout and I like the movement shown by the exhaust from the smokestack. I think I would like a wider angle to get more of the building in at the left. Here is an example of the limits of the crop sensor camera. A full frame sensor at the same zoom length would have been awesome with 40% more frame space!!', '2013-01-28 23:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966103, 1050379, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of layers in the composition.</td>', 'Wonderful use of layers in the composition.', '2013-01-28 23:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966104, 1050840, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think you win by shooting from the highest elevation!</td>', 'I think you win by shooting from the highest elevation!', '2013-01-28 23:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966105, 1050430, 10785, '<td valign="top">Oh decisions, whether to include the duck or not... It is a big part of the scene and is cropped off. This football pitch is quite unusual though!!</td>', 'Oh decisions, whether to include the duck or not... It is a big part of the scene and is cropped off. This football pitch is quite unusual though!!', '2013-01-28 23:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966106, 1050448, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit too bright by a half stop or more. I am noticing quite a bit of noise in the shadow area, like there wants to be detail there but it should be pitch black. It''s a tough scene to expose for and you did get the mid toned sidewalk exposed all right. However the highlighted area is blown and the shadows are too bright.</td>', 'I think this is a bit too bright by a half stop or more. I am noticing quite a bit of noise in the shadow area, like there wants to be detail there but it should be pitch black. It''s a tough scene to expose for and you did get the mid toned sidewalk exposed all right. However the highlighted area is blown and the shadows are too bright.', '2013-01-28 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966107, 1050551, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing.</td>', 'Nice use of framing.', '2013-01-28 23:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966140, 1050854, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid and abstract combined together.</td>', 'Lovely candid and abstract combined together.', '2013-01-29 01:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966141, 1050836, 9668, '<td valign="top">Great angle. Nice addition of the human element. I personally don''t care for the hdr-style editing, but DPC likes it so there you go.</td>', 'Great angle. Nice addition of the human element. I personally don''t care for the hdr-style editing, but DPC likes it so there you go.', '2013-01-29 01:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966142, 1050556, 9668, '<td valign="top">Fun capture of the final put! The slight blurryness of the entire image is bothersome, but I like the blur of the club and the ball.</td>', 'Fun capture of the final put! The slight blurryness of the entire image is bothersome, but I like the blur of the club and the ball.', '2013-01-29 01:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966143, 1050862, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awesome portrait. Good example of where a square crop works well.</td>', 'Awesome portrait. Good example of where a square crop works well.', '2013-01-29 01:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966144, 1050131, 9668, '<td valign="top">I may be mistaken, but Portland, OR? Near OMSI? <br/> <br/>Looks like this image was taken in the 1890s, I like that.</td>', 'I may be mistaken, but Portland, OR? Near OMSI?  Looks like this image was taken in the 1890s, I like that.', '2013-01-29 01:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966150, 1050340, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.</td>', 'Love the colors.', '2013-01-29 02:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966151, 1050111, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the symmetry.</td>', 'Love the symmetry.', '2013-01-29 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966152, 1050688, 9668, '<td valign="top">great lighting. why does the sky seem so blurred?</td>', 'great lighting. why does the sky seem so blurred?', '2013-01-29 02:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966153, 1050849, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely twilight shot. Cool how the eye moves around this image.</td>', 'Lovely twilight shot. Cool how the eye moves around this image.', '2013-01-29 02:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966154, 1050756, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the mix of gold and blues.</td>', 'Love the mix of gold and blues.', '2013-01-29 02:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966155, 1050788, 9668, '<td valign="top">HDR styling? Doesn''t seem necessary on this image. Maybe my eye is just picking that up.</td>', 'HDR styling? Doesn''t seem necessary on this image. Maybe my eye is just picking that up.', '2013-01-29 02:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966156, 1050753, 9668, '<td valign="top">lovely monocrome. I like the grit.</td>', 'lovely monocrome. I like the grit.', '2013-01-29 02:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966158, 1050266, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the surreal effect of this image!</td>', 'Love the surreal effect of this image!', '2013-01-29 02:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966160, 1050037, 9668, '<td valign="top">Guessing I''ll see this with a ribbon on the homepage (just wondering if I''ll join you up there or not &lt;grin&gt;). Love the depth of tones, reflections of clouds and how the eye moves through the image.</td>', 'Guessing I''ll see this with a ribbon on the homepage (just wondering if I''ll join you up there or not <grin>). Love the depth of tones, reflections of clouds and how the eye moves through the image.', '2013-01-29 03:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966161, 1050759, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is stellar. Fantastic lighting. Would like to see more of the right side of the image cropped in favor of the fascinating textures and lines in the middle.</td>', 'This is stellar. Fantastic lighting. Would like to see more of the right side of the image cropped in favor of the fascinating textures and lines in the middle.', '2013-01-29 03:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966162, 1050373, 9668, '<td valign="top">Fantastic title.</td>', 'Fantastic title.', '2013-01-29 03:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966216, 1050375, 12611, '<td valign="top">great composition. a great and secret vantage point.</td>', 'great composition. a great and secret vantage point.', '2013-01-29 08:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966218, 1050131, 12611, '<td valign="top">antiquity and modernity blending effortlessly, reminds me of the Hudson at Fort lee NJ.</td>', 'antiquity and modernity blending effortlessly, reminds me of the Hudson at Fort lee NJ.', '2013-01-29 08:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966219, 1050088, 12611, '<td valign="top">Such a moody and ominous sky, giving a sinister appearance to a probably benign hamlet.</td>', 'Such a moody and ominous sky, giving a sinister appearance to a probably benign hamlet.', '2013-01-29 08:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966220, 1050111, 12611, '<td valign="top">Ha, the dripping sarcasm and cultural-social commentary!</td>', 'Ha, the dripping sarcasm and cultural-social commentary!', '2013-01-29 08:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966221, 1050637, 12611, '<td valign="top">Cool Idea, and well shot.</td>', 'Cool Idea, and well shot.', '2013-01-29 08:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966222, 1050828, 12611, '<td valign="top">A terrific slice of life.</td>', 'A terrific slice of life.', '2013-01-29 08:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966223, 1050819, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful display of warmth cutting through the chill.</td>', 'Beautiful display of warmth cutting through the chill.', '2013-01-29 08:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966224, 1050037, 12611, '<td valign="top">Terrific detail, and perfect placement of the glossy blacks.</td>', 'Terrific detail, and perfect placement of the glossy blacks.', '2013-01-29 08:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966226, 1050373, 12611, '<td valign="top">Surprisingly the diamond plate isn''t too bad, and for me what makes the shot is the detail and color on the perimeter.</td>', 'Surprisingly the diamond plate isn''t too bad, and for me what makes the shot is the detail and color on the perimeter.', '2013-01-29 08:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966227, 1050477, 12611, '<td valign="top">That composition just guides the viewers eyes down the slope to the beach, and home to the setting sun...</td>', 'That composition just guides the viewers eyes down the slope to the beach, and home to the setting sun...', '2013-01-29 08:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966429, 1050756, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view of beautiful country.</td>', 'Beautiful view of beautiful country.', '2013-01-29 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966430, 1050574, 27617, '<td valign="top">if this doesn''t blue.....</td>', 'if this doesn''t blue.....', '2013-01-29 15:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966431, 1050788, 114225, '<td valign="top">Seems like this is missing out on the low range of the histogram. Maybe increasing the contrast a bit could help.</td>', 'Seems like this is missing out on the low range of the histogram. Maybe increasing the contrast a bit could help.', '2013-01-29 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966432, 1050375, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great angles in this.</td>', 'Great angles in this.', '2013-01-29 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6966434, 1050854, 114225, '<td valign="top">I imagine some find the red a good touch, but for me it distracts from the subject.</td>', 'I imagine some find the red a good touch, but for me it distracts from the subject.', '2013-01-29 15:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
