(6973852, 1050719, 138630, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful viaduct and a lovely scenic - the repeating arches and gentle curve are so very nice.  Congrats on the tiny violin.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful viaduct and a lovely scenic - the repeating arches and gentle curve are so very nice.  Congrats on the tiny violin.', '2013-02-06 21:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6973855, 1050814, 96833, '<td valign="top">The body most certainly adds interest and especially intrigue. I think it would be rather one dimensional without. Well done! I like the position of the model and choice of white shirt w/ black pants. What I don''t quite like is the framing; top edge is right on the window frame &amp; stair post, and the bottom edge feels uncomfortable for me what with the rail covering the level below and making that area feel tight, but these aren''t major flaws.<br/> <br/>This has a film-noir feel to it. Also looks like something Hitchcock might have created.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-06 22:19:58.</i></td>', 'The body most certainly adds interest and especially intrigue. I think it would be rather one dimensional without. Well done! I like the position of the model and choice of white shirt w/ black pants. What I don''t quite like is the framing; top edge is right on the window frame & stair post, and the bottom edge feels uncomfortable for me what with the rail covering the level below and making that area feel tight, but these aren''t major flaws. This has a film-noir feel to it. Also looks like something Hitchcock might have created.', '2013-02-06 21:47:55.000000', '2013-02-06 22:19:58.000000', 0),
(6973857, 1050860, 138630, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear - I''m not crazy about going over to the edge and looking down either.  Still, this could only have been taken from a height.</td>', 'Crisp and clear - I''m not crazy about going over to the edge and looking down either.  Still, this could only have been taken from a height.', '2013-02-06 21:52:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6973860, 1050836, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is very nice - the descending figure adds a lot to the impact.  I really like the way the receding diamonds nest in one another.</td>', 'This is very nice - the descending figure adds a lot to the impact.  I really like the way the receding diamonds nest in one another.', '2013-02-06 22:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6974800, 1050430, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nothing like tiny human figures to lend a sense of scale to a scene.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Nothing like tiny human figures to lend a sense of scale to a scene.  Cool shot.', '2013-02-07 22:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6974812, 1050788, 138630, '<td valign="top">You ARE high - and far away, too.  What a vista!</td>', 'You ARE high - and far away, too.  What a vista!', '2013-02-07 22:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
